  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Financial Recommendations" as CFR004
  system --> AIFR002 : Provide User Profiles and Goals for Tailored Advice  

  usecase "AIFR005: Generate Investment Opportunity Analyses Based on Risk Tolerance" as AIFR005  
  client --> AIFR005 : Request Portfolio Diversification Strategies  

  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  system --> AIFR003 : Monitor Transaction Patterns for Anomalies  

  usecase "AIFR012: Generate Personalized Client Dashboards" as AIFR012  
