  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as CFR007
  system --> AIFR004 : Align Recommendations with Client's ESG Preferences  

  usecase "AIFR006: Generate Anomaly Transaction Alerts for Compliance" as AIFR006  
  client --> AIFR006 : Receive Notifications of Potential Fraudulent Activities  

