  system --> AIFR013 : Extract Relevant Financial News for Portfolios  

  usecase "AIFR007: Generate Contextualized News Insights Based on Holdings" as AIFR007  
  client --> AIFR007 : Stay Informed About Market Impacts On Investments  

  usecase "CFR010: Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors" as CFR010
